            "new_store_block_n4Wiqw": {
              "type": "_new-store-block",
              "name": "New Store",
              "settings": {
                "name": "Bag Spa (repair centre)",
                "desc": "<p>Is your Crumpler Bag feeling a little under the weather? Bring it into our Bag Spa, located upstairs above our Melbourne Flagship store on Little Bourke Street. This is your bag’s sanctuary, a place where our skilled repairs team gives your bag thoughtful restoration.<br/><br/>From spare parts to signs of wear and tear, we offer a full menu of wellness treatments to bring balance and calm back to your beloved bag. At Bag Spa you can also find our Benchwarmer collection, a range of second hand bags for sale.<br/><br/>Monday to Saturday 10am - 6pm<br/>Sunday - Closed<br/>---</p><p><a href=\"tel: +61 0461 516 678\" title=\"tel: +61 0461 516 678\">+61 0461 516 678</a><br/><a href=\"mailto:bagspa@crumpler.com.au\" title=\"mailto:bagspa@crumpler.com.au\">bagspa@crumpler.com.au<br/></a><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/NENTD52CbKbLYM4d9\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/NENTD52CbKbLYM4d9\">Level 1, 349 Little Bourke St, Melbourne</a></p>"
